// The grand stair: the house's hub, a tall well of landings that every way passes through.
//
// From the floor, steps climb to two landings, each by a pair of doors that will not open yet:
// the feast's on the west and the gardens' on the east. Above the landings the walls are sheer.
// Cling up the west wall to the music room's door and the gallery across the well;
// cling up the east wall from the gallery to the Doorman's hall.
// The letter room's door is high in the west wall, a Lunge from the platforms in the middle.
[room]
name = grand_stair
background = foyer a06030
music = ballroom muffled

